            "detailed_description": "<h1>Included Content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/7489a0b58496cebcaa6c3780d96e9483.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=292 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/4a56a59d9cad0953673e3365f99ae4c2.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/4a56a59d9cad0953673e3365f99ae4c2.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/4a56a59d9cad0953673e3365f99ae4c2.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepara-te para uma experiência RPG galardoada com esta edição definitiva do Persona 5 Royal, que inclui um monte de conteúdo transferível adicional!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/328a6d52f69adfedc4b21f536df81fa1.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/328a6d52f69adfedc4b21f536df81fa1.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/328a6d52f69adfedc4b21f536df81fa1.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forçado a transferir-se para um liceu em Tóquio, o protagonista tem um sonho estranho. “És realmente um prisioneiro do destino. Num futuro próximo, a ruína espera por ti.” Com o objetivo da “reabilitação” pendente, ele terá de salvar outros dos seus desejos sombrios ao vestir a máscara de um Phantom Thief. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/f81136451bb443d4a94c45fc840f187f.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/f81136451bb443d4a94c45fc840f187f.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/f81136451bb443d4a94c45fc840f187f.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Principais destaques:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explora Tóquio, desbloqueia Personas, personaliza a tua base de operações, descobre finais alternativos e mais ainda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Torna-te o melhor Phantom Thief e desafia as convenções, descobre o poder dentro de ti e luta pela justiça na versão definitiva do Persona 5 Royal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Inclui mais de 40 itens de conteúdos adicionais lançados anteriormente </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Escolhe entre as vozes em japonês e inglês </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/66245cc07724138b2bedfa3a5361a278.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/66245cc07724138b2bedfa3a5361a278.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/66245cc07724138b2bedfa3a5361a278.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/4a56a59d9cad0953673e3365f99ae4c2.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/4a56a59d9cad0953673e3365f99ae4c2.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/4a56a59d9cad0953673e3365f99ae4c2.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepara-te para uma experiência RPG galardoada com esta edição definitiva do Persona 5 Royal, que inclui um monte de conteúdo transferível adicional!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/328a6d52f69adfedc4b21f536df81fa1.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/328a6d52f69adfedc4b21f536df81fa1.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/328a6d52f69adfedc4b21f536df81fa1.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forçado a transferir-se para um liceu em Tóquio, o protagonista tem um sonho estranho. “És realmente um prisioneiro do destino. Num futuro próximo, a ruína espera por ti.” Com o objetivo da “reabilitação” pendente, ele terá de salvar outros dos seus desejos sombrios ao vestir a máscara de um Phantom Thief. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/f81136451bb443d4a94c45fc840f187f.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/f81136451bb443d4a94c45fc840f187f.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/f81136451bb443d4a94c45fc840f187f.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Principais destaques:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explora Tóquio, desbloqueia Personas, personaliza a tua base de operações, descobre finais alternativos e mais ainda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Torna-te o melhor Phantom Thief e desafia as convenções, descobre o poder dentro de ti e luta pela justiça na versão definitiva do Persona 5 Royal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Inclui mais de 40 itens de conteúdos adicionais lançados anteriormente </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Escolhe entre as vozes em japonês e inglês </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/66245cc07724138b2bedfa3a5361a278.poster.avif?t=1783356822\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/66245cc07724138b2bedfa3a5361a278.webm?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687950/extras/66245cc07724138b2bedfa3a5361a278.mp4?t=1783356822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
